      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Altamont%2C_Tennessee"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Founded in 1848 as Grundy County’s seat, Altamont grew around the courthouse and river trade.",
